Falsifies `non_volatile_memory_express::verification::identify_parse_accepts_exactly_the_formats_without_metadata`.

The defect: `parse_identify_namespace` stops reading the Metadata Size of the format in use. A
namespace formatted with metadata then parses as if each logical block carried only its data, and
a buffer sized from its shift is too small.

Expected to fail: the harness's `assert_eq!(parsed.is_some(), metadata == 0 && (9..=12).contains(&shift))`.

